## 📁 Repository Directory Structure

```text
├── .gitlab/                  # GitLab CI/CD Automation Pipelines
├── ansible/
│   ├── inventory/            # Hosts inventory mapping secure VPN IPs
│   ├── playbooks/
│   │   ├── system_prep.yml   # Configures NVIDIA Drivers, CUDA, and Container Toolkit
│   │   ├── vpn_setup.yml     # Automated configuration of WireGuard/Tailscale Mesh
│   │   └── spark_deploy.yml  # Compiles and deploys distributed Apache Spark nodes
│   └── roles/                # Modular Ansible configuration components
├── docker/
│   ├── Dockerfile.spark      # Custom Spark build integrated with NVIDIA RAPIDS Toolkit
│   └── docker-compose.yml    # Spark cluster composition files (Master/Worker Topologies)
├── config/
│   └── spark-defaults.conf   # Optimized hardware properties configuration
├── LICENSE                   # GPL-3.0 Strict Legal Copyleft Shield
└── README.md                 # Technical Operations Blueprint
```

